// .asciidoctorconfig
//
// IntelliJ-only AsciiDoc attributes for editor preview and warning suppression.
// At build time, the asciidoctor-maven-plugin (configured in
// docs/userguide/sources-asciidoc/pom.xml and
// docs/installationguide/sources-asciidoc/pom.xml) substitutes these from
// the Maven properties declared in docs/pom.xml. This file mirrors those
// values purely for the editing experience.
//
// Values reflect the post-rebrand state (Naikeri). When the actual rebrand
// commit lands in docs/pom.xml, no update to this file is needed.
//
// Per-file attributes ({configtxt}, {path}, {systemtxt}, {toclevels-value})
// are NOT mirrored here, since they have intentional per-file scope and are
// declared inline in the .adoc files that use them.

